60290	\N	Breeze Blue Large Serving Bowl	simple	The breeze blue large serving bowl is a deep bowl that features a blue undertone all around and an intricate pattern. Hand-glazed for an artisan-made look and handcrafted by the professional artisans.\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Material</strong>: Ceramic\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>Hand-glazed and hand-painted.</li>\r\\n \t<li>Sold individually.</li>\r\\n \t<li>Lead-free.</li>\r\\n \t<li>Food, oven, microwave, and dishwasher safe.</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<strong>Dimensions: </strong>Overall: 9'' Diameter X 3'' Depth\r\\n<h5 data-start="729" data-end="748">Important Note:</h5>\r\\n<p data-start="749" data-end="968">As each piece is handmade and hand-painted, very slight variations in design, pattern, and shape may occur. Subtle brushstrokes may also be visible on the back, highlighting the authenticity and uniqueness of every piece.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h5 data-start="970" data-end="983">Shipping:</h5>\r\\n<p data-start="984" data-end="1066">Orders are typically delivered within <strong data-start="1022" data-end="1045">10–21 business days</strong> via courier service.</p>	&nbsp;\r\\n<p data-start="25" data-end="204">Introducing the elegant <strong data-start="49" data-end="83">Breeze Blue Large Serving Bowl</strong> — a beautifully handcrafted piece designed to bring freshness, sophistication, and artisanal charm to your dining table.</p>\r\\n<p data-start="206" data-end="520">This deep ceramic bowl features soothing blue undertones that flow gracefully across its surface, complemented by an intricate hand-painted pattern. The design reflects a perfect harmony of traditional craftsmanship and contemporary elegance, making it a standout piece for both everyday use and special occasions.</p>\r\\n<p data-start="522" data-end="825">Each bowl is carefully hand-glazed to achieve a smooth, refined finish while preserving its authentic artisan-made character. Crafted by skilled artisans, every piece carries subtle variations in pattern and texture, ensuring that no two bowls are exactly alike and each one holds its own unique beauty.</p>\r\\n<p data-start="827" data-end="1090">With its generous size and deep structure, this serving bowl is ideal for presenting a variety of dishes such as curries, rice, salads, or snacks. It not only serves a functional purpose but also enhances your table presentation with a refined and artistic touch.</p>\r\\n<p data-start="1092" data-end="1303">Made from premium ceramic, this bowl is lead-free and safe for food use. It is designed for modern convenience and is suitable for oven, microwave, and dishwasher use, combining practicality with timeless style.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id="1sb5zx1" data-start="1305" data-end="1325">Product Details:</h3>\r\\n<p data-start="1326" data-end="1554"><strong data-start="1326" data-end="1341">Collection:</strong> Breeze Blue<br data-start="1353" data-end="1356" /><strong data-start="1356" data-end="1369">Material:</strong> Premium Ceramic<br data-start="1385" data-end="1388" /><strong data-start="1388" data-end="1399">Finish:</strong> Hand-glazed and hand-painted<br data-start="1428" data-end="1431" /><strong data-start="1431" data-end="1443">Sold as:</strong> Individually<br data-start="1456" data-end="1459" /><strong data-start="1459" data-end="1470">Safety:</strong> Lead-free and food-safe<br data-start="1494" data-end="1497" /><strong data-start="1497" data-end="1507" data-is-only-node="">Usage:</strong> Suitable for oven, microwave, and dishwasher</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id="v4kudb" data-start="1556" data-end="1571">Dimensions:</h3>\r\\n<p data-start="1572" data-end="1609"><strong data-start="1572" data-end="1584">Overall:</strong> 9" Diameter x 3" Depth</p>\r\\n<p data-start="1611" data-end="1768" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bring home the Breeze Blue Large Serving Bowl and elevate your dining experience with a perfect blend of elegance, craftsmanship, and everyday functionality.</p>\r\\n<strong>EXPLORE MORE</strong>\r